  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to promoting dialogue between leaders and population</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will consist of plan trips of exchanges between young people of two border towns of Goma and Gisenyi to allow a fraternity between neighbours and to create spaces of dialogue between the State, ecclesial authorities and population.   This will therefore organise trips exchange between Goma and Gisenyi population and to make conferences-debates in the parishes on the themes of peaceful coexistence.</narrative>
  </description>
